Subject: [PATCH] episode_features: forks by onward direction clusters (edge <=
 3.5 m, 60 deg), decoys exclude environmental categories, radius 3 m,
 n_decoy_categories

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
